# 7. Enter the ID retrieved. 

## Tool(s)

- [`steghide`](https://github.com/StegHigh/steghide)

## Walkthrough

Run the following command:

```bash
❯ steghide --extract -sf ssdog1.jpeg
Enter passphrase:
```

Since <a href="#03">the answer in question 3</a> told us that we do not need password any more, we just press enter to the the result.

```bash
❯ steghide --extract -sf ssdog1.jpeg
Enter passphrase:
wrote extracted data to "idInsider.txt".
❯ cat idInsider.txt
0726ba878ea47de571777a
```

## Answer: `0726ba878ea47de571777a`

